  "_note": [
    "Board 148:2, the panel's landing screen. PROBE, and the reason is identity",
    "rather than reach: CollectionManager mints ids from generateId() and persists",
    "them, so `content-collection-<id>` would name a different element on every run",
    "and a new collection would accumulate per page load. The probe stubs the",
    "MANAGER and keeps everything above it — useContentPanel, ContentTab and all",
    "seven views — as shipped. The same mount serves collection / record / fields /",
    "variables / conditions / data-sources, navigated by the panel's own rows.",
    "",
    "BOARD won, in a shared primitive conformed to ITS OWN component board:",
    "232:6 (List row) gives its three text nodes line-heights the shared row",
    "classes leave to the face — label and chevron 13/20, count 11/16. Live the",
    "label's box was 16 inside a 32 row, so every list in the panel sat 4px tighter",
    "than the board. Fixed inside ListRow.tsx (and RecordRow.tsx, whose 240:14 says",
    "the same), NOT in ROW_LABEL_CLASS/ROW_META_CLASS/ROW_CHEVRON_CLASS — NavItem,",
    "TreeRow and VersionRow share those and are measured against their own boards.",
    "Both rows also gained per-instance `row-<part>-<rowTestId>` ids so the text",
    "nodes are addressable at all; the literal prefix is what check-anchors needs.",
    "",
    "NOT anchored, and why:",
    "  148:2 the board frame — white fill and a gray-100 hairline on all four sides.",
    "  That is the drawer's chrome in the shipped app, not ContentTab's; the panel",
    "  paints neither. Measured on the shell's own boards.",
    "  I…;232:7, the four 16px icon SLOTS, each carrying border-radius 2. A radius",
    "  on a square holding a stroked Lucide glyph is a Figma frame artifact — the",
    "  glyph has no corner to round and the live span has none.",
    "  148:40 spacer (a Figma frame; the panel does it with flex) and the four",
    "  hotspot/* nodes (prototype wiring).",
    "",
    "CONTRAST: 3 recorded, all ink-muted on bg-subtle at 4.39 — the two band labels",
    "and the collections count. Specified by this board; the 39-instance token",
    "defect in docs/design-jobs/FIGMA-TO-CODE/CONTRAST-INK-MUTED.md."
  ]
}
